  "description": "A schematic and diagram control for Avalonia. Electronic schematics, mindmaps, flowcharts, UML and architecture drawings on one node-port-connection core: wires route themselves around parts and each other, junction dots follow the drawing conventions, and one call gives you the net list. Eighty symbols included. Freeware, commercial use included. Preview release: the API may change before 12.1.0 final.",
